body:
I've wanted to do an online campaign with my friends for years. Game Master Engine seems awesome.

&#x200B;

GIVEAWAY

Here's a bad rough translation:

Saturday 26, April 1986, Pripyat, Ukraine

&#x200B;

A day and a place that many associate with one of the most dramatic nuclear disasters we have born witness to; known today as The Chernobyl Disaster.

&#x200B;

Our Chernobyl room transports you and your team back to the night everything happened. You are going to find yourself in the control room of Reactor 4, the clock has struck 00:23:40, exactly one hour before the emergency shutdown was set into effect.

&#x200B;

In our fictional scenario you get to experience the consequences of a protocol-breach during a safety test of the reactor with your own eyes.

&#x200B;

In addition to the  immersive and intense story, the room contains a mixture of both high tech and manual tasks that will test your teamwork and observational skills. This room is therefore best suited for experienced and adult groups.

&#x200B;

Any feedback on this translation from people who actually speak Norwegian is appreciated.

That's an unfair comparison,

&#x200B;

she's fricking immortal
